    <briefdescription>
<para>keeps the internal buffers of the sweep-line triangulation alive between runs, so a caller triangulating many contour sets one by one avoids re-allocating them on every call; the entries returning a <ref refid="classMR_1_1Mesh" kindref="compound">Mesh</ref> move the topology and the points out into it, so those two grow again on the next run, while triangulateDisjointContoursTopology keeps everything; one cache must not be used by several threads at once Generated from class <computeroutput><ref refid="classMR_1_1PlanarTriangulation_1_1ISweepLineCache" kindref="compound">MR.PlanarTriangulation.ISweepLineCache</ref></computeroutput>. This is the const half of the class. </para>
    </briefdescription>
